{"Name":"Ping","Description":"Test Connectivity","Script":"from SiemplifyAction import SiemplifyAction\nfrom McAfeeMvisionEDRV2Manager import McAfeeMvisionEDRV2Manager\nfrom SiemplifyUtils import output_handler\nfrom ScriptResult import EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED, EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\nfrom TIPCommon import extract_configuration_param\nfrom constants import PING_SCRIPT_NAME, INTEGRATION_NAME\n\n\n@output_handler\ndef main():\n    siemplify = SiemplifyAction()\n    siemplify.script_name = PING_SCRIPT_NAME\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Param Init -----------------\")\n\n    # Configuration\n    api_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"API Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n\n    iam_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"IAM Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n\n    client_id = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Client ID\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    client_secret = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Client Secret\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    api_key = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"API Key\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    verify_ssl = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Verify SSL\",\n        default_value=True,\n        input_type=bool,\n    )\n\n    scopes = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Scopes\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Started -----------------\")\n    status = EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\n    connectivity_result = False\n\n    try:\n        siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"Connecting to McAfee Mvision EDR V2.\")\n        manager = McAfeeMvisionEDRV2Manager(\n            api_root,\n            iam_root,\n            client_id,\n            client_secret,\n            api_key,\n            scopes,\n            verify_ssl,\n            siemplify.LOGGER,\n        )\n        siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"Successfully connected to McAfee Mvision EDR V2.\")\n        output_message = \"Successfully connected to the McAfee Mvision EDR V2 server with the provided connection parameters!\"\n        siemplify.LOGGER.info(output_message)\n        connectivity_result = True\n        status = EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        output_message = (\n            f\"Failed to connect to the McAfee Mvision EDR V2 server! Error is {e}\"\n        )\n        siemplify.LOGGER.error(\n            f\"Connection to V2 API failed, performing action {PING_SCRIPT_NAME}\"\n        )\n        siemplify.LOGGER.exception(e)\n\n    siemplify.end(output_message, connectivity_result, status)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","IntegrationIdentifier":"McAfeeMvisionEDRV2","ScriptResultName":"is_success","DynamicResultsMetadata":null,"Creator":"admin","IsEnabled":true,"IsCustom":true,"AiGenerated":false,"IsSystem":false,"Version":1.0,"TimeoutSeconds":600,"IsAsync":null,"AsyncPollingIntervalInSeconds":3600,"TotalIntervalTimeoutForAsyncInSeconds":86400,"Parameters":[],"DefaultResultValue":null,"PythonVersion":"None","ActionType":1,"SimulationData":{"Entities":[]},"SimulationDataJson":"{\"Entities\": []}","AICategories":[],"AIDescription":"### General Description\\n\\nThe **Ping** action is a diagnostic utility designed to verify the connectivity and authentication between Google SecOps and the McAfee Mvision EDR V2 platform. It ensures that the integration is correctly configured and that the system can successfully communicate with the McAfee API endpoints.\\n\\n### Parameters Description\\n\\n| Parameter Name | Type | Mandatory | Description |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| N/A | N/A | N/A | This action does not have any input parameters. It relies on the integration's global configuration settings. |\\n\\n### Additional Notes\\n\\n- This action utilizes the integration's configuration parameters, including API Root, IAM Root, Client ID, Client Secret, API Key, and Scopes.\\n- It is primarily used for initial setup verification and troubleshooting connectivity issues.\\n\\n### Flow Description\\n\\n1. **Parameter Extraction**: The action retrieves the integration's global configuration parameters.\\n2. **Manager Initialization**: It initializes the McAfee Mvision EDR V2 manager class.\\n3. **Authentication Check**: During initialization, the manager attempts to retrieve an OAuth access token from the IAM service using the provided credentials via a GET request.\\n4. **Connectivity Confirmation**: If the token is successfully retrieved, the action confirms that the connection is established and reports success.","EntityTypes":[]}